/target
.env
**/*.rs.bak
/node_modules
**/node_modules
.DS_Store
*.swp
/.idea
/.vscode/settings.json
/.claude/worktrees
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.next
# Per-worktree dev slots (#194). The manifest is host-local — slot
# numbers describe a single VM's port layout and shouldn't propagate
# across machines. The worktrees/ directory holds linked git worktrees
# created by `just worktree-new` and is similarly local.
/.dev-slots.json
/worktrees/
**/.env.slot

# Local runtime data. Stiglab defaults its DB to sqlite://./data/stiglab.db
# (see .env.example); the file is per-machine dev state, never committed.
/data/

# Codegraph local code-index (SQLite knowledge graph). Per-machine dev
# state built by `codegraph init/index`; never committed.
/.codegraph/

# Local host-port override for host-run cargo dev (machine-specific)
docker-compose.override.yml
compose.override.yml
